      "source": "user",
      "value": "Two layers, no code required to use either. (1) freecad/ - parametric source models driven by dimensions.txt, rebuilt via Rebuild FreeCAD Library.cmd, which regenerates STEP/STL exports and correctly scaled meshes. (2) godot/ - a spatial workbench that consumes those meshes. freecad is upstream of godot; exports are generated artefacts, never hand-edited."
